<title>GREECE: SOCCER-GREECE BEAT BOSNIA 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER. [CORRECTED 21:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GREECE BEAT BOSNIA 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER. [CORRECTED 21:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece beat Bosnia 3-0 (halftime</p>
<p>1-0) in a European zone group 1 World Cup qualifier in Kalamata</p>
<p>on Sunday.</p>
<p>(Corrects group).</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Greece - Marinos Ouzounidis (42nd minute), Stratos</p>
<p>Apostolakis (77th), Demis Nikolaidis (83rd)</p>
<p>Attendance - 7,000</p>
</text>
